`status: archived` resolves a thread and `open` reopens it. `body` edits the thread's first comment, which only its author can do. Team admins also pass spam verdicts here: `spam` holds the thread, `open` releases a held one, and `spamCommentId` narrows a verdict to one held reply.

```ts
