LINK PREVIEW METADATA:
The metaSiteName, metaSiteFaviconUrl, metaTitle, metaDescription, and metaImageUrl fields customize the preview card shown when a form URL is shared in apps like Slack, Discord, iMessage, and social platforms. They do not change the visible form content.

FIELD REFERENCES (Mentions):
Use {{questionUuid}} or {{Field Title}} to display a field's answer dynamically.
