Special email mentions:
Use {{allAnswers}} in selfEmail.body, respondentEmail.body to include all submitted question titles and answers.
Example: "A new response was submitted. {{allAnswers}}"
Use {{id}}, {{respondentId}}, or {{formName}} to include submission metadata in selfEmail and respondentEmail fields or in redirectOnCompletionUrl.
